msgid "**[Courses](https://doqumentation.org/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information)** — structured learning paths from quantum basics to utility-scale computing\n"
msgstr "**[Courses](https://doqumentation.org/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information)** — Strukturierte Lernpfade von Quantengrundlagen bis zu Utility-Scale-Computing\n"

